00:10:12,346 --> 00:10:13,537
machine.

295
00:10:13,783 --> 00:10:16,673
Let me put the whole machine together.

296
00:10:16,753 --> 00:10:19,313
A fee that locks in the habit.

297
00:10:19,313 --> 00:10:21,460
Shipping and video that make the fee

298
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:23,253
